   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "À condition de + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**À condition de** + infinitive (on condition of) when the subject is the same: **Je viendrai à condition de finir mon travail** (I'll come on condition of finishing my work)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "À condition que, à moins que",
     "texto": [
      "With different subjects the subjunctive is used: **à condition que** (on condition that) and **à moins que** (unless): **À moins que tu sois fatiguée, je viendrai** (unless you are tired, I'll come)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sauf si",
     "texto": [
      "**Sauf si** (except if) takes the indicative: **Sauf si tu as un problème** (except if you have a problem)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
